('MOV-2024-09-05-000004', 'It Ends With Us', 'Lily believes she`s found true love with Ryle, but when a painful incident triggers past trauma, she must decide if love alone can carry their relationship through. However, things are complicated when her first love returns to her life.', 'Romance', 'Malay, Chinese, Tamil', 'English', '02:11:00', 'Sony Pictures Releasing', 'Blake Lively, Justin Baldoni, Brandon Sklenar, Jenny Slate', '2024-07-30', '2024-08-16', '2024-09-01', , , '2024-09-04 10:39:19', '2024-09-04 10:41:52');
